        "• Step 4: Check immediate elastic settlement and primary consolidation settlement: $S_c = \\frac{C_c H_0}{1 + e_0}\\log_{10}\\left(\\frac{\\sigma_0' + \\Delta\\sigma'}{\\sigma_0'}\\right)$.",
